prompt.template:
Create an activity template JSON file for: {{templateName}}

Description: {{templateDescription}}
Category: {{category}}

Create the template file at: /tmp/{{templateId}}.json

The template must follow this structure:

{
  "name": "{{templateName}}",
  "description": "{{templateDescription}}",
  "category": "{{category}}",
  "task_steps": [
    {
      "id": "task-1",
      "subagent": "general",
      "description": "Clear description",
      "dependencies": [],
      "prompt": {
        "template": "Instructions for agent. Use {{variable}} syntax.",
        "max_tokens": 8000,
        "compression_strategy": "filter",
        "variables": [{"name": "var", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "What it does"}]
      },
      "validation": {
        "required_files": [],
        "required_patterns": [],
        "forbidden_patterns": ["TODO"],
        "commands": []
      },
      "retry": {"max_attempts": 2, "strategy": "simple"}
    }
  ],
  "variables": {},
  "context_requirements": []
}

Design 3-4 tasks that break down {{templateDescription}} into logical steps.
Keep task prompts SHORT (100-200 words each).
NO git-related checks.

After creating, validate:
cat /tmp/{{templateId}}.json | python3 -m json.tool > /dev/null
